---
import CasePhoto from "./CasePhoto.astro";
const {cases}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="cases-intro"><div class="ci-wrap"><div class="ci-copy"><span class="ci-eyebrow">Archivo / Asesoría integral</span><h1>Historias reales.<br/><em>Caminos distintos.</em></h1><p>Una transformación se entiende mejor cuando conoces su contexto. Explora qué buscaba cada persona, cómo fue su proceso y qué cuenta sobre su experiencia.</p><span class="ci-count">{cases.length} historias del estudio <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></span><small>Son procesos individuales de asesoría integral; no resultados de una cita aislada.</small></div><div class="ci-stories">{cases.map((item:any)=><article><div class="ci-pair"><figure><CasePhoto src={item.before} alt={`${item.nombre}, antes de su proceso`} width="400" height="600"/><figcaption>Antes</figcaption></figure><figure><CasePhoto src={item.after} alt={`${item.nombre}, después de su proceso`} width="400" height="600"/><figcaption>Después</figcaption></figure><a class="ci-compare" href={`#comparar-${item.slug}`} aria-label={`Comparar fotografías de ${item.nombre}`}><span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></a></div><span class="ci-meta">{item.duracion}</span><h2>{item.nombre}</h2><p>“{item.tagline}”</p><a class="ci-story-link" href={`#caso-${item.slug}`}>Conocer su historia <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<style>
 .cases-intro{padding:55px 0 65px;background:#eeeeee;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d3d3}.ci-wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:0 48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:65px;align-items:center}.ci-eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5c5c5c;display:block;margin-bottom:28px}.ci-copy h1{font:clamp(43px,4.6vw,63px)/1.05 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#404040}.ci-copy h1 em{color:#767676}.ci-copy>p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.95;color:#5c5c5c;max-width:420px;margin-top:26px}.ci-count{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:#5c5c5c;padding:21px 0 16px;border-top:1px solid #cecece;margin-top:30px;max-width:360px}.ci-count i{font-style:normal;font-size:21px}.ci-copy>small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;color:#5c5c5c;display:block;max-width:350px}.ci-stories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.ci-stories article:nth-child(2){padding-top:35px}.ci-pair{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3px;background:#d3d3d3;height:300px;overflow:hidden}.ci-pair figure{height:100%;position:relative;min-width:0}.ci-pair :is(img,svg){height:100%;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;transition:transform .4s}.ci-pair:hover :is(img,svg){transform:scale(1.03)}.ci-pair figcaption{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;background:#f0f0f0e8;padding:4px 6px;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#5c5c5c}.ci-compare{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0f0f0;color:#5c5c5c;box-shadow:0 2px 12px #0002;font-size:23px}.ci-meta{display:block;font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#5c5c5c;margin:18px 0 10px}.ci-stories h2{font:26px/1.1 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#464646;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ci-stories article>p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#5c5c5c;margin-top:10px;min-height:40px}.ci-story-link{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cccccc;color:#5c5c5c}.ci-story-link>span{font-size:20px}.cases-intro a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #838383;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:950px){.ci-wrap{padding:0 24px;gap:35px}.ci-pair{height:250px}.ci-stories{gap:15px}.ci-stories h2{font-size:23px}}@media(max-width:700px){.cases-intro{padding:35px 0 45px}.ci-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.ci-copy h1{font-size:46px}.ci-stories article:nth-child(2){padding-top:25px}.ci-pair{height:240px}.ci-stories{gap:13px}.ci-meta{font-size:7px}.ci-stories h2{font-size:22px}}@media(max-width:380px){.ci-pair{height:215px}}
</style>

<style>
.ci-copy h1 em,.ci-eyebrow,.ci-story-link>span{color:#C41230!important}.ci-compare{background:#C41230!important;color:#fff!important}
</style>
